      "text": {
        "hi": "राजा कृष्णदेवराय ख़ुश होकर एक चित्रकार को मुख्यमंत्री बना देते हैं, पर उसे राज चलाना नहीं आता। तेनाली रामन एक बढ़ई से खाना बनवाकर राजा को उनकी गलती समझाते हैं!",
        "hinglish": "Raja Krishnadevaraya khush hokar ek chitrakaar ko mukhyamantri bana dete hain, par use raaj chalaana nahi aata. Tenali Raman ek badhai se khaana banwaakar raja ko unki galti samjhaate hain!",
        "en": "King Krishnadevaraya happily makes a painter his chief minister, but the painter cannot run the state. Tenali Raman has a carpenter cook a meal to show the king his mistake!"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "B8.06.1.S02",
      "skills": [
        "book.words",
        "vocab.meaning"
      ],
      "question": "What is Tenali Raman famous for?",
      "questionMeaning": {
        "hi": "तेनाली रामन किस लिए मशहूर हैं?",
        "hinglish": "Tenali Raman kis liye mashhoor hain?"
      },
      "options": [
        "his wit and clever ideas",
        "his paintings",
        "his strength"
      ],
      "answer": "his wit and clever ideas",
      "modelAnswer": "Tenali Raman was a poet in the court of King Krishnadevaraya. He is famous for his wit and clever solutions to problems.",
      "modelMeaning": {
        "hi": "तेनाली रामन राजा कृष्णदेवराय के दरबार में कवि थे। वे अपनी हाज़िरजवाबी और चतुर उपायों के लिए मशहूर हैं।",
        "hinglish": "Tenali Raman Raja Krishnadevaraya ke darbaar mein kavi the. Woh apni haazirjawaabi aur chatur upaayon ke liye mashhoor hain."
      }
    },
